    <briefdescription>
<para>mathicgb (<computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemgb" kindref="compound">mgb</ref></computeroutput>) callback that polls the engine&apos;s interrupt flag during a long-running GB computation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subclass of <computeroutput><ref refid="classmgb_1_1_groebner_configuration_1_1_callback" kindref="compound">mgb::GroebnerConfiguration::Callback</ref></computeroutput> whose <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m_g_b_callback_a96e6de04ee61bec60e0da3cf4b5b55f2_1a96e6de04ee61bec60e0da3cf4b5b55f2" kindref="member">call()</ref></computeroutput> is invoked periodically by mathicgb. Each call increments <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m_g_b_callback_a03e0ffae588fc567970a811cffc22a12_1a03e0ffae588fc567970a811cffc22a12" kindref="member">mCallCount</ref></computeroutput> and checks <computeroutput><ref refid="interrupted_8cpp_a5035d07c37876dc3b866e1d4457ff390_1a5035d07c37876dc3b866e1d4457ff390" kindref="member">system_interrupted()</ref></computeroutput>; on interrupt it sets <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m_g_b_callback_a3fd0d33f6d6cbed7f21a52ddcb224e40_1a3fd0d33f6d6cbed7f21a52ddcb224e40" kindref="member">mInterrupted</ref></computeroutput> and returns <computeroutput><ref refid="classmgb_1_1_groebner_configuration_1_1_callback_a8a187ba2ec19fd0e821cdf95d0526f5e_1a8a187ba2ec19fd0e821cdf95d0526f5eabdb1a9441308bd1b4d63c42fc3ff513e" kindref="member">StopWithNoOutputAction</ref></computeroutput> so mathicgb tears down its work cleanly without producing a partial GB. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
